[local] keyboard layout indicator for the bar (dwl-patches kblayout exists for 0.7/0.8 only and also switches the layout per client, which is not wanted here). Whenever the active xkb group changes, dwl writes kblayout_names[group] to $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kblayout_file and sends SIGUSR1 to the pid in $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kblayout_pidfile if it is still kblayout_comm (config.h)

